# What `railway up` leaves out of its upload (docs/DEPLOY.md section 9).
#
# The CLI reads this file on top of .gitignore, and this file wins where they
# disagree. It skips `.git` and `node_modules` on its own. .gitignore only counts
# inside a git checkout: uploaded from a copy with no `.git`, this file is the
# only filter, so it repeats what the image build never reads (the .dockerignore
# set). Gitignore syntax: a leading `/` anchors a pattern at the repo root, and
# a later line wins over an earlier one.

# Desktop release files: they live in the euchre-downloads bucket, never in the
# image (docs/DEPLOY.md section 9).
/downloads/

# Agent tooling
/.claude
/.codex
/.agents
/.mcp.json

# Rust and JS build output (the image builds its own)
target/
/.cargo-targets/
.turbo/
.svelte-kit/
build/
dist/
/.vercel
/coverage

# Secrets and local runtime state
.env
.env.*
.rivet
.rivetkit
*.db

# Docs, art sources and scratch (root `assets` only; apps/desktop/assets stays)
/docs/
/assets/
*.blend1
*.log
.DS_Store
